/A <</Type /Action
/S /URI
/URI (mailto:?subject=Primary%20source%20archive%20of%20documented%20institutional%20persecution%20%E2%80%94%20potential%20research%20object&body=Dear%20%5BResearcher%27s%20name%5D%2C%0A%0AI%20write%20to%20bring%20to%20your%20attention%20what%20may%20constitute%20a%20unique%20research%20object%20for%20scholars%20working%20in%20%5Badministrative%20law%20%2F%20human%20rights%20%2F%20disability%20studies%20%2F%20psychiatry%20and%20law%20%2F%20whistleblower%20protection%20%2F%20institutional%20accountability%5D.%0A%0AThe%20Barran%20Dodger%20Legal%20%26%20Ethical%20Trust%20Fund%20\(ABN%2078%20833%20496%20164\)%20maintains%20a%20publicly%20accessible%20archive%20of%203%2C643%20primary%20source%20government%20documents%20spanning%2035%20years%20\(1990%E2%80%932026\)%20documenting%20alleged%20systematic%20institutional%20persecution%20of%20Dr.%20Richard%20William%20McLean%20by%2013%20Australian%20government%20agencies.%0A%0ACharacteristics%20of%20potential%20scholarly%20interest%3A%0A%0AEVIDENTIARY%20COMPLETENESS%0AThe%20archive%20is%20notable%20for%20its%20evidentiary%20density%20%E2%80%94%20every%20claim%20is%20sourced%20to%20primary%20documents%20generated%20by%20the%20agencies%20themselves.%20The%20archive%20has%20been%20downloaded%201%2C100%2C000%2B%20times%20across%206%20continents.%20Not%20one%20named%20institution%20has%20filed%20a%20defamation%20action.%0A%0AAI%20VERIFICATION%20METHODOLOGY%0A52%20independent%20forensic%20AI%20analyses%20\(using%20GPT%2C%20Claude%2C%20and%20Gemini\)%20have%20verified%20675%20propositions%20drawn%20from%20the%20archive.%20Every%20proposition%20is%20traceable%20to%20primary%20source%20documents.%20Zero%20propositions%20have%20been%20contradicted.%20This%20methodology%20may%20be%20of%20interest%20to%20scholars%20examining%20AI%20applications%20in%20legal%20evidentiary%20analysis.%0A%0AINTERNATIONAL%20PROCEEDINGS%0AICC%20Article%207%20\(crimes%20against%20humanity\)%20submission%20formally%20received.%20OHCHR%20case%20reference%20UR%2FUST%2F23%2FAUS%2F17%20registered%20in%20Geneva.%20The%20international%20legal%20record%20is%20established%20and%20documented.%0A%0ABLOCKCHAIN%20PROVENANCE%0AAll%20documents%20are%20timestamp-sealed%20on%20Bitcoin%20blockchain%20\(Block%20897%2C241\).%20The%20archive%20includes%20full%20OpenTimestamps%20verification.%0A%0AThe%20archive%20is%20publicly%20available%20at%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com.%20I%20would%20welcome%20any%20scholarly%20engagement%20with%20this%20material.%0A%0AYours%20sincerely%2C%0A%5BYour%20name%5D)>>>>
endobj
