/URI (mailto:?subject=Potential%20article%20subject%3A%20documented%20case%20of%20institutional%20whistleblower%20persecution%20%E2%80%94%20primary%20source%20archive&body=Dear%20Editorial%20Team%2C%0A%0AI%20write%20to%20propose%20this%20case%20as%20a%20potential%20subject%20for%20%5Byour%20journal%5D%20coverage%20or%20analysis.%0A%0AThe%20Barran%20Dodger%20archive%20documents%20a%2035-year%20case%20of%20alleged%20systematic%20institutional%20persecution%20of%20Australian%20whistleblower%20Dr.%20Richard%20William%20McLean%20by%2013%20government%20agencies.%20The%20archive%20contains%203%2C643%20primary%20source%20government%20documents%2C%20is%20publicly%20accessible%2C%20blockchain-sealed%2C%20and%20has%20been%20AI-verified%20across%2052%20independent%20analyses%20\(675%2F675%20propositions%20confirmed\).%0A%0AWhat%20distinguishes%20this%20case%20as%20a%20potential%20scholarly%20subject%3A%0A%0A1.%20EVIDENTIARY%20COMPLETENESS%20%E2%80%94%20Unlike%20most%20whistleblower%20cases%2C%20the%20entire%20evidentiary%20record%20is%20publicly%20accessible%20in%20primary%20source%20form.%20The%20agencies%27%20own%20documents%20constitute%20the%20evidence%20base.%0A%0A2.%20INTERNATIONAL%20LEGAL%20STANDING%20%E2%80%94%20ICC%20Article%207%20submission%20formally%20received%3B%20OHCHR%20case%20UR%2FUST%2F23%2FAUS%2F17%20registered.%0A%0A3.%20METHODOLOGICAL%20INNOVATION%20%E2%80%94%20The%20archive%20employs%20AI%20forensic%20analysis%20for%20evidentiary%20verification%20%E2%80%94%20a%20potentially%20novel%20application.%0A%0A4.%20ABSENCE%20OF%20CONTESTATION%20%E2%80%94%201%2C100%2C000%2B%20downloads%3B%20zero%20defamation%20actions%3B%20no%20factual%20rebuttal%20from%20any%20named%20institution.%20Open%20Professional%20Challenge%20closes%207%20September%202026.%0A%0AFull%20archive%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%0APress%20kit%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%2Fpress%0AAcademic%20citations%3A%20https%3A%2F%2Fbarrandodger.com%2Facademic-record%0A%0AABN%2078%20833%20496%20164%20%E2%80%94%20Barran%20Dodger%20Legal%20%26%20Ethical%20Trust%20Fund%0A%0AI%20am%20available%20to%20discuss%20further.%0A%0AYours%20sincerely%2C%0A%5BYour%20name%5D)>>>>
